<!--Post: 134--><!--Time: 1085854901-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST134"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, May 29, 2004 - 11:21 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Glad you reminded everyone, Sandy. <BR> <BR>If the Wichita police actually contributed materials to <i>America&#39;s Most Wanted</i> for this episode, I&#39;ll be very surprised.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 134-->
<!--Post: 144--><!--Time: 1085957613-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST144"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sandy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sandy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, May 30, 2004 - 3:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Sorry Tom , No surprise.I wonder why they didn&#39;t mention Kathryn Bright ? I know her brother wouldn&#39;t want to be seen on TV,he is trying to get on with his life,and has a family now.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 144-->
<!--Post: 145--><!--Time: 1085959981-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST145"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sandy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sandy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, May 30, 2004 - 4:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This killer sure did his homework on Zodiac, he even left the phone dangling ! Tom I found more BTK letters,I will give them to you this week. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
